1) WHat is Docker ?
      Docker is a tool used to package an application along with all its dependencies ( libraries, configurations, runtime, etc.,) into a small unit called a container.
                                    or
      Docker is a containerization platform that allows developers to build, package and run applications consistently across different environments.


2) What is Container ?
      A container is a lightweight, isolated environment that packages an application along with all its dependencies and configuration, 
       allowing it to run consistently across different environments. Docker is the most commonly used container platform.
